	"descriptionMarkdown": "# 🚀 Factorio Tileable Science Blueprints (Nauvis)\n\nThis one contains a **blueprint book** with **all science pack production lines** for Nauvis.  \nThe layouts are designed to be:\n\n- 🔄 **Fully tileable** – scale production by repeating modules without redesign.  \n- 🏗️ **Compact & organized, more or less** – easy to integrate into any factory bus or modular base.  \n- ⚡ **Balanced** – input/output ratios tuned for smooth science throughput.  \n- 🧪 **All sciences included** – from **Automation (red)** to **Purple**, everything is covered.  \n\n---\n\n## 📦 Contents\n\nThe blueprint book includes tileable setups for:\n\n- 🔴 Automation (Red) science  \n- 🟢 Logistic (Green) science  \n- 🔵 Chemical (Blue) science  \n- ⚫ Military (Gray/Black) science  \n- 🟣 Production (Purple) science  \n- 🟡 Utility (Yellow) science  \n\n---\n\n## 🧩 How to Use\n\n1. Import the blueprint book string into Factorio.  \n2. Place the science blocks on your bus or supply lines.  \n3. Tile additional blocks to increase throughput as your factory grows.  \n\n---\n\n## 🗺️ Integration Tips\n\n- Align the builds along a **main bus** for easy input of plates, circuits, oil products, etc.  \n- Works seamlessly on **Nauvis vanilla maps** without modifications.  \n\n---\n\n## ✅ Benefits\n\n- It looks dope\n\n---\nTy ChatGPT",
